🚀 Excited to launch "SyncXel Developer Hub" — a modular UI component ecosystem built for modern full-stack developers and indie hackers!

As developers, we’ve all spent hours piecing together landing pages, authentication flows, and footers, struggling to keep a consistent design system across components. That’s why I built SyncXel.

✨ What makes it different?
Every component pack (Navbars, Auth, Hero, Pricing, Footers, and more) is meticulously engineered across 5 core design families:
🔹 Modern Slate (Developer Vibe)
🔹 Neo-Brutalism
🔹 Glassmorphism & Neon Glow
🔹 Clean Minimalist (SaaS)
🔹 Vibrant Gradient

🛠️ What's inside?
- 🔓 Free micro-snippets for daily copy-paste workflows.
- ⚡ Pro UI packs with production-ready React, Tailwind CSS, & Framer Motion.
- 💳 Lifetime access model integrated seamlessly via Lemon Squeezy.

Whether you're building your next SaaS MVP or scaling a client project, SyncXel helps you ship faster with absolute visual consistency.

